ENGINEERING STANDARDS

This software computes geometric design criteria from published engineering
relationships. It does NOT reproduce, embed or redistribute any table, figure or
text from the AASHTO "A Policy on Geometric Design of Highways and Streets"
(the Green Book) or from any other copyrighted standard.

Every coefficient the relationships require -- side friction factor, driver
perception-reaction time, deceleration rate, driver eye height, object height,
maximum relative gradient, maximum grade -- is a runtime INPUT with a documented
default. The defaults shipped here are illustrative values used to make the tool
runnable. They are NOT an adopted agency standard, and this software makes no
claim that they are. An engineer or agency applying this tool supplies the
criteria their jurisdiction has adopted.

